# rewaita
===
Rewaita gives your Adwaita apps a fresh look by colorizing them with popular theme's palettes.

Features:

- Modify application window controls

- Make/edit custom themes

- Palette swap/tint wallpapers

- Add effects like transparency, window borders, or sharp corners

Changes only affect GTK3/4 applications; other UI toolkits are not affected
